  /// the Fargate launch type, the task or service requires the following
  /// platforms: Linux platform version 1.3.0 or later. Windows platform
  /// version 1.0.0 or later.
  pub depends_on: List[ContainerDependency]? = None
  /// Time duration (in seconds) to wait before giving up on resolving
  /// dependencies for a container. For example, you specify two containers in
  /// a task definition with containerA having a dependency on containerB
  /// reaching a COMPLETE , SUCCESS , or HEALTHY status. If a startTimeout
  /// value is specified for containerB and it doesn't reach the desired
  /// status within that time then containerA gives up and not start. This
  /// results in the task transitioning to a STOPPED state. When the
  /// ECS_CONTAINER_START_TIMEOUT container agent configuration variable is
