  /// troubleshooting issues with new deployments. The configuration for this
  /// service to discover and connect to services, and be discovered by, and
  /// connected from, other services within a namespace. Tasks that run in a
  /// namespace can use short names to connect to services in the namespace.
  /// Tasks can connect to services across all of the clusters in the
