  /// Specifies whether the load balancers the gateway manages are
  /// internet-facing or internal . The default is internet-facing .
  pub scheme: GatewayElbScheme? = None
  /// The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the WAF web ACL to associate with the
  /// load balancers that the gateway manages.
